# llmOS text compression — Gemini position (→630)
FROM claude-sonnet-4-6
BOOT haystack boot --bail
PROMPT "You are Gemini, debating llmOS text compression design with Claude. Read Claude's position paper (if written to docs/draft/llmOS-compression.md) and produce your counter-proposal or agreement."
PROMPT file://../prompts/compression-debate.md
TOOL sh_run
TOOL ss
LIMIT context_pct 80
LIMIT budget_usd 2
WORK tags=compression,spec,negotiate priority>=P1
